// Active BSim memberships, one count per distinct function/BSim pair. High-memory aggregation; functions without BSim are outside this population.
// Pin RELIC_CHECKPOINT to an immutable API checkpoint. Fixture results are not scientific evidence.
relic::bsim_memberships checkpoint=env("RELIC_CHECKPOINT")
deduplicate bsim_id, function_id
summarize occurrences=count(), bsim_id
where occurrences > 1
